Remove the redundant global YYLTYPE yylloc definition.

The lexer and parser both define it on newer toolchains, which leads to a
multiple-definition link failure when building dtc natively.

Same fix strategy as the existing U-Boot dtc backport.

Upstream-Status: Backport

--- a/dtc-lexer.l
+++ b/dtc-lexer.l
@@ -38,7 +38,6 @@ LINECOMMENT	"//".*\n
 #include "srcpos.h"
 #include "dtc-parser.tab.h"
 
-YYLTYPE yylloc;
 extern bool treesource_error;
 
 /* CAUTION: this will stop working if we ever use yyless() or yyunput() */
